 "what": "OpenTimestamps anchors for the registers' day manifests. Each manifest carries the SHA-256 of every preserved byte of its night, so one anchor covers the night. Proofs are pending until upgraded; a pending proof is a calendar's promise, a complete one stands on a Bitcoin block alone.",
